=== pair_conflict: named cases ===
iterator agreement                 query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
stencil read p-1                   query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread
strided disjoint 2p vs 2p+1        query Disjoint     oracle disjoint    
non-injective match p+q            query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread
mixed radix s+4t (fits)            query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
mixed radix s+4t (overlaps)        query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread
fixed disjoint slices              query Disjoint     oracle disjoint    
transposed access                  query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread
read row 0                         query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread
offset loop bounds [2,5]           query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
width-1 parallel symbol            query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
rank mismatch declines             query Cross_thread oracle same-thread 
flattened [Sub_axis; p]            query Same_thread  oracle opaque      
shared static symbol               query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
cross-nest aligned                 query Same_thread  oracle same-thread 
cross-nest chain-position swap     query Cross_thread oracle cross-thread

=== pair_conflict: exhaustive sweep (same-nest, pairs=[p]) ===
Cross_thread/cross-thread    50
Cross_thread/same-thread     4
Disjoint/disjoint            6
Same_thread/same-thread      4

